      "message": "**File:** `util/focaltech/updater.cc` (and similarly for `usb_context.h`)\n\n**Corrected Snippet:**\n\n```c\n/* Copyright 2026 The ChromiumOS Authors\n * Use of this source code is governed by a BSD-style license that can be\n * found in the LICENSE file.\n */\n\n#include \u003calgorithm\u003e\n#include \u003ccstdint\u003e\n#include \u003cfstream\u003e\n#include \u003cspan\u003e\n#include \u003cstring_view\u003e\n#include \u003cvector\u003e\n\n// Third-party libraries come AFTER standard C++ libraries\n#include \u003copenssl/sha.h\u003e\n\n#include \"ft_log.h\"\n#include \"ft_scsi.h\"\n#include \"ft_util.h\"\n\n```\n\n* **Rationale:** To prevent hidden dependencies, headers must be included in a strict order: 1\\) The related header, 2\\) C system headers, 3\\) C++ standard library headers, 4\\) Other libraries\u0027 headers, 5\\) Your project\u0027s headers. OpenSSL (`\u003copenssl/sha.h\u003e`) is a third-party library and belongs in group 4\\.  \n* **Google Style Guide:** [Names and Order of Includes](https://google.github.io/styleguide/cppguide.html#Names_and_Order_of_Includes)",
